{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Sugar Log 是一款為減糖與控糖人士而設的飲食紀錄工具，適合想了解每日糖分與碳水化合物攝取量的人使用。餐點、飲水與體重紀錄集中於同一個私人日記，並以圖表呈現進度。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>控糖紀錄與飲食資料庫</h2>\n<p>應用提供糖分日記，可按餐別記錄並加入備註，內建食物資料庫列出糖分與碳水化合物含量，並就精製與全穀主食提供高升糖指數提示。使用者亦可記錄飲水與體重，配合每日簽到、成就與實用小提示，並以圖表及時間軸檢視習慣變化。資料以離線優先方式儲存於裝置，無需註冊帳戶。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-139-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-140-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-141-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-142-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-143-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Sugar Log – Daily Sugar Diary</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T22:58:42.664529+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}